==Release==
===Broadcast===
The third season premiered on June 21, 2026.<ref name="S3Premiere">{{Cite web|last=Goldbart|first=Max|date=April 27, 2026|title=HBO Unveils Trailer & Premiere Date For ''House Of The Dragon'' Season 3|url=https://deadline.com/2026/04/house-of-the-dragon-season-3-trailer-premiere-date-june-21-1236873319/|website=[[Deadline Hollywood]]|access-date=April 27, 2026}}</ref>

=== International broadcast ===
{{See also|List of HBO international channels}}
In New Zealand, the series is distributed by [[Sky (New Zealand)|Sky]]'s [[HBO (New Zealand)|SoHo]] TV channel and [[Neon (service)|Neon]] streaming service.<ref>{{Cite news |date=October 6, 2021 |title=Games of Thrones prequel ''House of the Dragon'' drops first trailer |work=[[The New Zealand Herald]] |url=https://www.nzherald.co.nz/entertainment/games-of-thrones-prequel-house-of-the-dragon-drops-first-trailer/ZF7IEKLBYT45TSCNUYPJHHCXFE/ |url-status=live |access-date=October 7, 2021 |url-access=subscription |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211006232700/https://www.nzherald.co.nz/entertainment/games-of-thrones-prequel-house-of-the-dragon-drops-first-trailer/ZF7IEKLBYT45TSCNUYPJHHCXFE/ |archive-date=October 6, 2021}}</ref> In the Philippines, [[Sky Cable|SKY]] broadcasts the show via its main cable television services and other digital streaming platforms.<ref>{{Cite press release |title=SKY brings ''House of the Dragon'' to PH viewers on HBO GO this August |date=July 23, 2022 |publisher=ABS-CBN Corporate |url=https://corporate.abs-cbn.com/newsroom/news-releases/2022/7/23/sky-brings-hotd-to-pinoy-viewers-on-hbo-go?lang=en |access-date=September 24, 2022 |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220923173900/https://www.abs-cbn.com/newsroom/news-releases/2022/7/23/sky-brings-hotd-to-pinoy-viewers-on-hbo-go?lang=en |archive-date=September 23, 2022}}</ref> In India, [[JioHotstar]] distributes the show.<ref>{{Cite web |date=July 21, 2022 |title=''House of the Dragon'' trailer: The power of dragons is unleashed as "a woman cannot inherit the Iron Throne" |url=https://www.hindustantimes.com/entertainment/tv/house-of-the-dragon-trailer-it-s-a-lethal-fight-for-the-iron-throne-once-again-101658368733934.html |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220812170057/https://www.hindustantimes.com/entertainment/tv/house-of-the-dragon-trailer-it-s-a-lethal-fight-for-the-iron-throne-once-again-101658368733934.html |archive-date=August 12, 2022 |access-date=July 21, 2022 |website=Hindustan Times}}</ref> In the UK, Ireland, Italy, Germany, Austria and Switzerland, the series airs on [[Sky Atlantic]] and its accompanying streaming service [[Now (Sky)|Now]].<ref>{{Cite web |date=July 20, 2022 |title=Watch the official trailer for ''House of The Dragon'', exclusively on Sky and NOW on Monday 22 August |url=https://www.skygroup.sky/en-gb/article/watch-the-official-trailer-for-house-of-the-dragon-exclusively-on-sky-and-now-on-monday-22-august |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220801135249/https://www.skygroup.sky/en-gb/article/watch-the-official-trailer-for-house-of-the-dragon-exclusively-on-sky-and-now-on-monday-22-august |archive-date=August 1, 2022 |access-date=July 20, 2022 |website=Newsroom Sky Group}}</ref> In Canada, ''House of the Dragon'' is available on [[Bell Media]]'s [[Crave (streaming service)|Crave]] streaming service and its [[HBO (Canadian TV channel)|HBO]] linear channel.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Jaffer |first=Murtz |date=August 15, 2022 |title=She-Hulk, a documentary about cats and the ''Game of Thrones'' prequel: Here's what to stream on Netflix, Crave and more this week |url=https://www.thestar.com/entertainment/television/she-hulk-a-documentary-about-cats-and-the-game-of-thrones-prequel-here-s-what/article_00eff253-8328-557a-94ef-8530fa4e3f33.html |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220817002411/https://www.thestar.com/entertainment/television/2022/08/15/she-hulk-a-documentary-about-cats-and-the-game-of-thrones-prequel-heres-what-to-stream-on-netflix-crave-and-more-this-week.html |archive-date=August 17, 2022 |access-date=August 16, 2022 |url-access=subscription |website=[[Toronto Star]]}}</ref> In Australia, the series is available for streaming on [[Binge (streaming service)|Binge]] and [[Foxtel]].<ref>{{Cite web |last=Cartwright |first=Lexie |date=August 22, 2022 |title=How to watch ''House of the Dragon'' in Australia |url=https://www.news.com.au/entertainment/tv/streaming/how-to-watch-house-of-the-dragon-in-australia/news-story/c971821a3a7df3ad0c1300e3ba3362ff |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220816160405/https://www.news.com.au/entertainment/tv/streaming/how-to-watch-house-of-the-dragon-in-australia/news-story/c971821a3a7df3ad0c1300e3ba3362ff |archive-date=August 16, 2022 |access-date=September 6, 2022 |website=news.com.au}}</ref>
